    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds good in theory, but in practice, we can't do everything. Resources are limited. If you were forced to choose just one for 12-year-olds because of budget and time constraints, which one would actually do them more good? Is it better to ground them in a sense of pride and belonging first, or is it more important to teach them to be critical of the systems they live in? One of these has to be the priority.",
