      "content": "Given the immense pressure on 12-year-olds to feel safe and connected in a sense of community, establishing a foundation of trust and shared values is the more critical priority right now. Without that initial sense of belonging, students may become too defensive or disengaged to process the more complex and sometimes painful aspects of systemic injustice effectively. You should prioritize the \"shared values\" approach to build the classroom unity necessary to eventually introduce critical analysis without causing division.",
